# External Python runtime closure for the target CPython 3.12.13 parity profile.
# Keep Starlette-RS itself out of this registry lock: parity-prepare-target
# installs it separately from STARLETTE_RS_SOURCE with --no-deps.
# AnyIO is the external runtime dependency declared by starlette-rs-py==0.1.0.
# pydantic-core is listed directly because fastapi-rs calls its runtime APIs.
# annotated-doc is included only to preserve the parity comparator's shared
# source/target package identity set; FastAPI-RS does not import it.
# The remaining pins preserve the source profile's Pydantic runtime closure.
